{"abstract":"The Department of Commerce is amending the Export Administration Regulations (EAR) by adding seventy-six entities to the Entity List. These entities have been determined by the U.S. Government to be acting contrary to the national security or foreign policy interests of the United States and are listed on the Entity List under the destination of Russia. This rule also revises four existing entries on the Entity List under the destination of Russia.","action":"Final rule.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","name":"Commerce Department","id":54,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","parent_id":null,"slug":"commerce-department"},{"raw_name":"Bureau of Industry and Security","name":"Industry and Security Bureau","id":241,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/industry-and-security-bureau","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/241","parent_id":54,"slug":"industry-and-security-bureau"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2023/02/27/2023-04099.html","cfr_references":[{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"744","title":15}],"citation":"88 FR 12155","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"This rule is effective February 24, 2023.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Docket No. 230221-0048"],"dockets":[{"supporting_documents":[],"agency_name":"BIS","documents":[{"comment_count":0,"comment_start_date":"2023-02-27","updated_at":"2023-04-27T16:56:43.977-04:00","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/BIS-2023-0010-0001","allow_late_comments":null,"id":"BIS-2023-0010-0001","comment_end_date":null,"regulations_dot_gov_open_for_comment":false}],"supporting_documents_count":0,"id":"BIS-2023-0010","title":"Additions of Entities to the Entity List; Revisions of Entities on the Entity List"}],"document_number":"2023-04099","ef